<section class="cs-shell cs-setup">
  <header class="cs-hero">
    <img class="cs-mark" src="modules/cold-storage/assets/branding/project-palimpsest.png" alt="Project Palimpsest">
    <div>
      <p class="cs-kicker">PALIMPSEST RECOVERY NODE // BAY CITY 2384</p>
      <h2>Cold Storage: The Faces We Left Behind</h2>
      <p>Import or update the source-controlled actors, sleeves, skills, contacts, relationships, factions, revelations and journals.</p>
    </div>
  </header>
  <div class="cs-command-row">
    <button class="cs-primary" type="button" data-action="import"><i class="fa-solid fa-database"></i> Import / Update Cold Storage</button>
    <span class="cs-status">GM AUTHORING CONSOLE</span>
  </div>
  <section class="cs-panel">
    <div class="cs-panel-head"><h3>Six-of-eight selection</h3><span>ACTIVE DHF LOADOUT</span></div>
    <p>Select exactly six pregens. The remaining two are flagged as reserve/missing stacks.</p>
    <div class="cs-pregen-grid">{{#each pregens}}<div class="cs-pregen"><label><input type="checkbox" name="activePregen" value="{{id}}" {{#if checked}}checked{{/if}}> <strong>{{name}}</strong></label><div class="cs-assign"><select data-user-for="{{id}}"><option value="">Unassigned</option>{{#each ../users}}<option value="{{id}}">{{name}}</option>{{/each}}</select><button type="button" data-action="assign" data-pc-id="{{id}}">Assign</button></div></div>{{/each}}</div>
    <button class="cs-primary" type="button" data-action="applySelection">Apply six-pregen selection</button>
  </section>
  <p class="cs-hint"><i class="fa-solid fa-lock"></i> Ownership is intentionally explicit. Contacts and GM identity data remain GM-only as Foundry Documents.</p>
</section>
